{"page_id": "olmo_old_scans-88-p1", "markdown": "# Official Business,\n\nCrmmonwealth of Hassachusetts.\n\nEXECUTIVE DEPARTMENT.\n\nMir Clana C. Barton\n\nMass\n\nCopy -\n\nCOMHONWEAITH\n\nOF\n\nMASSACHUSETTS.\n\nEXECUTIVE DEPARTMENT.\n\nBoston,\n\nNarch 24th, 1862.\n\nMiss Clara H. Barton\n\nNorth Oxford,\n\n1a88.\n\nI bag to assure you,\n\nMies Barton, of my cordial\n\nsympathy with your most vorthy aantiments\n\nand wishes; and\n\nthat if I have any power to promote your design in aid of our soldiers I will frealy uss it.\n\nWhenaver you may be\n\nready to visit Gan'l. Burnsides division I will cheerfully give you a letter of introduction, with my hearty approval of your visit and my tastimony to the valus of the servics to our sick and wounded, it will be in your power to tender.\n\nWith high respect I am\n\nYour ob. servant\n\nJohn A. Andrews.", "width": 8534, "height": 5971, "blocks": [{"kind": "heading", "text": "Official Business,", "bbox": {"x": 671.7725941190677, "y": 2077.4104166000257, "width": 709.0932944606415, "height": 74.6375000000004}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Crmmonwealth of Hassachusetts.", "bbox": {"x": 311.0058305927843, "y": 2176.927083257687, "width": 1405.7463556851312, "height": 111.95625000000027}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "EXECUTIVE DEPARTMENT.", "bbox": {"x": 496.53394089527796, "y": 2291.5980640570815, "width": 1034.7371280770258, "height": 96.24958789249297}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Mir Clana C. Barton", "bbox": {"x": 853.4000166512429, "y": 2630.083338062193, "width": 2240.174962035421, "height": 319.87498983144707}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Mass", "bbox": {"x": 2600.0087437294137, "y": 3408.4458318820484, "width": 572.2507288629737, "height": 261.2312500000004}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Copy -", "bbox": {"x": 5805.3845225933665, "y": 495.23151216121437, "width": 304.5109931011587, "height": 103.97393213013812}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "COMHONWEAITH", "bbox": {"x": 5345.678185666787, "y": 976.5611915900989, "width": 753.0976108406447, "height": 135.71434562802327}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "OF", "bbox": {"x": 6182.795918989358, "y": 970.2874985487157, "width": 136.84256559766752, "height": 87.07708333333302}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "MASSACHUSETTS.", "bbox": {"x": 6429.787069798389, "y": 940.7563054417242, "width": 824.164218046227, "height": 108.83151316444084}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "EXECUTIVE DEPARTMENT.", "bbox": {"x": 5532.603887322446, "y": 1252.2974088681292, "width": 1261.9587398339997, "height": 149.21977628668185}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Boston,", "bbox": {"x": 6218.556349587321, "y": 1565.6971674186445, "width": 438.69912279312535, "height": 98.29638275702723}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Narch 24th, 1862.", "bbox": {"x": 6665.556728866305, "y": 1511.6900775164838, "width": 1037.089982858552, "height": 153.44122878313053}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Miss Clara H. Barton", "bbox": {"x": 4513.222749552572, "y": 1985.3768260439954, "width": 1187.0550051764221, "height": 136.37980620265046}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "North Oxford,", "bbox": {"x": 4739.728863668949, "y": 2102.2895830406364, "width": 783.7346938775519, "height": 99.51666666666698}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "1a88.", "bbox": {"x": 5548.344022603391, "y": 2089.849999803586, "width": 323.44606413994126, "height": 74.63749999999973}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "I bag to assure you,", "bbox": {"x": 5110.405786292044, "y": 2263.858670980329, "width": 1236.1746214708157, "height": 145.37424246172063}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Mies Barton, of my cordial", "bbox": {"x": 6329.267283598418, "y": 2192.7475810696665, "width": 1573.8272208833828, "height": 174.0623031169175}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "sympathy with your most vorthy aantiments", "bbox": {"x": 4525.286405335794, "y": 2429.1180414389205, "width": 2443.724899514423, "height": 192.25312478045575}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "and wishes; and", "bbox": {"x": 7001.988601293656, "y": 2399.3939005038887, "width": 899.7449560582467, "height": 116.28657210270555}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "that if I have any power to promote your design in aid of our soldiers I will frealy uss it.", "bbox": {"x": 4517.926817826608, "y": 2590.372420108064, "width": 3417.212823228308, "height": 435.7920909722648}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Whenaver you may be", "bbox": {"x": 6665.68150677098, "y": 2794.3223456531573, "width": 1149.7501556796856, "height": 139.52783071796102}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "ready to visit Gan'l. Burnsides division I will cheerfully give you a letter of introduction, with my hearty approval of your visit and my tastimony to the valus of the servics to our sick and wounded, it will be in your power to tender.", "bbox": {"x": 4538.940022712212, "y": 2959.0752409367565, "width": 3599.610985358324, "height": 854.1015525023146}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "With high respect I am", "bbox": {"x": 5147.331017269061, "y": 3822.862619203165, "width": 1336.8156831479982, "height": 162.05521458586054}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Your ob. servant", "bbox": {"x": 5632.860001532139, "y": 4015.441438663827, "width": 976.2026758444215, "height": 147.07599292198796}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "John A. Andrews.", "bbox": {"x": 6256.057502436401, "y": 4408.818281450621, "width": 960.2031684185952, "height": 108.42108412086964}}], "ms": 616.439458}